{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d9fd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b3cf-5753-7b41-a2b3-ce03595a21fa"},"sequence":2905,"recorded_at":1780531400005805,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f856bb23-ad72-4bdf-8e88-2c200bbb093c","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"f856bb23-ad72-4bdf-8e88-2c200bbb093c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f856bb23-ad72-4bdf-8e88-2c200bbb093c"},"call_id":"call_01a0b3e538c67096a1987bfb87e26ac4","text":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 119-128\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 49 narrowing rows plus the\n-harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED control. Every row weakens one\n-gate to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and\n-every killer drives the production `Normalize` entry over real\n-captured bytes. `N-native-type-token` and `N-protection-encrypted`\n-are the token-preserving attacks: the searched-for text still\n-matches while the decision changes, and the killers execute the\n-behavioral suite. No row is an arm-delete; no plant covers two\n-sites. The battery runs twice with one raw log per plant per run\n-carrying the subprocess exit.\n+`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 62 narrowing rows, 2 labelled\n+non-narrowing rows, and the harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED\n+control. Every narrowing weakens one gate to admit exactly one\n+member of the class it must reject, and every killer drives the\n+production `Normalize` entry over real captured bytes.\n+`N-native-type-token` and `N-protection-encrypted` are the\n+token-preserving attacks: the searched-for text still matches\n+while the decision changes, and the killers execute the\n+behavioral suite. `N-empty-projection` is labelled single-member\n+class and `N-overflow-truncate` is labelled behaviour swap; no\n+other row is an arm-delete, and no plant covers two sites. The\n+battery runs twice with one raw log per plant per run carrying\n+the subprocess exit.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-1cyj0q/worktree/internal/cloneproject/TRACEABILITY.md","added":13,"removed":10},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
