{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ddd3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b3cf-5753-7b41-a2b3-ce03595a21fa"},"sequence":3396,"recorded_at":1780531400006787,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f856bb23-ad72-4bdf-8e88-2c200bbb093c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f856bb23-ad72-4bdf-8e88-2c200bbb093c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f856bb23-ad72-4bdf-8e88-2c200bbb093c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b3e7-a68a-7d70-b3d3-28c58b126ee4"},"task_id":"01a0b3e7-a68a-7d70-b3d3-28c58b126ee4","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b3e7-a68a-7d70-b3d3-28c58b126ee4","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 189-201\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-- `section:7.8` is bound FULL (2/2): clause `7.8#1` (large data by\n-  reference) discharges through the new `clone-projection-fidelity`\n-  acceptance case (`TestNormalizeInlineContentBoundary`); clause\n-  `7.8#2` (execution bindings equal freshly read facts) discharges\n-  through the new `session-adapter-call-binding` case\n-  (`TestCheckCallBinding` plus the zero-facts refusal test, both\n-  committed by the sessadapter owner).\n-- `section:10.2` is bound FULL (5/5): `10.2#1` through\n-  `clone-capture-contracts`, `10.2#3`–`10.2#5` through\n-  `clone-native-capture`, and `10.2#2` through both\n-  `clone-native-capture` (capture install) and\n-  `clone-projection-fidelity` (overflow install and idempotent\n-  replay).\n+- `section:7.8` is bound FULL (2/2) with a `sessadapter`\n+  production owner: clause `7.8#1` (large data by reference,\n+  never embedded in the 8 MiB frame) discharges through the new\n+  `session-adapter-frame-bound` case\n+  (`TestDecodeRequestFrameRefusesOversizeFrame` and\n+  `TestFrameBoundEdges`, both committed by the sessadapter\n+  owner); clause `7.8#2` (execution bindings equal freshly read\n+  facts) discharges through the new\n+  `session-adapter-call-binding` case